{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And they said to him, Where is, etc.</b> The explanation is: in the tidings that the bearer of news came to deliver, it was to Sarah that he was to bring tidings, and they wished to reveal to Abraham that they had come to bring tidings to Sarah and not to him. Therefore they said to him, <b>Where is Sarah</b> — meaning: to her we have come to bring tidings. And Abraham answered, <b>Here she is in the tent</b> — to hear all that you would say to her."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:41:55.114122378Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}